'''''Calliandra tweediei''''' is a species of [[flowering plant]]s of the genus ''[[Calliandra]]'' in the family [[Fabaceae]]. The plant is native to the [[Atlantic Forest]] ecoregion in southeastern [[Brazil]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.consultaplantas.com/index.php/en/care-plants-from-a-to-c/1790-calliandra-tweediei-or-mexican-flame-bush-care-and-growing|title = Calliandra tweediei or Mexican Flame bush &#124; Care and Growing}}</ref>

